Package: dockbert
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: dock panel for application icons and folders
 DockBert is a dock: a panel of application icons, folders and Tracker
 items that can run standalone or be embedded, with an options inner
 panel and Tracker-aware menus.
